  "details": "Download size for cross platform compatible worlds appear to be listing a smaller download size then their actual download size is for PC.\n\nI assume it is showing the quest world size or last uploaded world size rather than the platform specific download size.\n\nFor example, the download size listed for the VRChat Hub says its 19.11MB but actual download size when going to the world is 37.04MB.\n\nNote that the same behaviour is also present in build 777.",
